{
  "scoring_tier": "consistency",
  "scoring_justification": "Full recompute from raw DFT E‑V data is infeasible because agent submits only final derived properties; however, derived elastic moduli and sound velocities can be verified for consistency with raw elastic constants and lattice‑parameter‑derived density, catching fabrication.",
